  "purpose": "TP4 qfd_io_collective pr2s (MARGIN-8 ot_rom_oneshot_die_m) through ref_tile, asked by [qwen-tp8] coordinator: pr2s-835975149 failed FF hold -67.7 (I2R 2,194 @ -384.6: the cfg IO reference REFGLOB *s0_v* sat ~400 ps later on the clock tree than the input pin flops) -> pin-flop median IO reference + cluster clock spine with clock entry on the input (S) face, child_lint-clean fold-slice view (coll_fold_slice_rt), floorplan restructured: one R0 slice column E (src faces the W glue column: heads + 4 FIFO macros under the rx face; sums exit E to out_data), cut through the slice column 0.08; same RTL/params/benches",
  "benches": [
   {
    "name": "coll_margin8_exact",
    "cmd": "python3 tools/qwen_coll_margin_bench.py --out {RUN}/bench/m8 --margin 8",
    "expect": "pass",
